, "time": "12000", "image": "engenn5le18ob11re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Speaking of dream jobs ... what do you want to do at the PR firm, Peter?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure yet. I heard they have great benefits. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, if you get the job, I'll come and visit you in Boston.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I will, too! While I was doing some research about travel destinations last year, I read that Bostonians are really open-minded people. The city has an eclectic mix of shops and restaurants. Perfect for you and me, V!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ok, so let's all move to Boston.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, Vanessa, you're too much.", "id": 3, "time": "23000", "image": "engenn5le18ob11re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le18ob11re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le18ob11re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn5le18ob11re6aud02"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Reunion"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "New Paths"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le18ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Past Time Expressions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are many ways to refer to specific times in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">three years ago </span> or last year when you talk about the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">in 2012</span> when you talk about a year in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">When I was \u2026 </span> to talk about a period of time."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expression \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" in \u2026 (month or year)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I went to Mexico in 2012.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" last \u2026 (day, month, time, etc.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I visited my Aunt Nelly last year.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" (number of months or years) \u2026  ago\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I bought my ticket 3 weeks ago.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"When I was ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I played in a basketball tournament when I was in high school.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I remember visiting San Francisco about 10 years ago. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "When I was in high school, I used to travel a lot."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense and Past Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished.   You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that     was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br>   Regular verbs end in <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"italic\">-ied</span>.  <br> Irregular verbs change in different ways. <br>  For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary did followed by the    verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask \u2026 </span>? <br><span class=\"italic\"> Did is</span> the past form of to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For Past Continuous, we add was/were + verb\u201cing\u201d to verbs.   <br>Some verbs need a change to the last letter to add \u201cing\u201d."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"do \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"did \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were doing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"carry \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"carried \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were carrying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pay  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"paid\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were paying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" travel  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"traveled\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were traveling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rip \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ripped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" was/were ripped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"   was/were having\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I did so much shopping when I was traveling in Europe."}, {"type": "example", "content": " They were talking when he ripped his jacket."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "interior designer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who helps you decorate a room"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I might get an interior designer to help me decorate this room."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are the words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chest"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large box used for storing things or clothes "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This chest is amazing!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nesting dolls"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of dolls that fit inside each other "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Those are nesting dolls I got in Russia."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "eclectic "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " diverse; from many places, cultures "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: San Francisco is a really eclectic city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "open-minded"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describing someone who is open to new ideas and people "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The people in San Francisco are open-minded."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "benefit "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a form of additional payment at work (vacation time, pension, health care)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: We have great benefits at work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "You're too much "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " Say this when you want to tell someone they are funny "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Oh, Sally. You're too much."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le18ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the role cards below."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one role."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use the modals <span class=\"italic\">will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span>, <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Be creative and have fun with your partner!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1</span>: You are at a festival and you see a tent with a sign that reads \u201cPsychic Readings\u201d. You are interested and enter the tent. Find out what the future holds for you.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2</span>: You are a psychic (you have special powers to see the future). A person enters your tent and wants to know what their future holds. Tell them an interesting story.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I act out a situation between a psychic and a customer. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I switch roles with my partner and practice again."}]}], "type": "sena"}